        "answer": {
          "short": "$8x^{\\frac52}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}8x^2\\sqrt{x}&=8x^2x^{1/2}\\\\8x^2\\sqrt{x}&=8x^{2+1/2}\\\\8x^2\\sqrt{x}&=8x^{5/2}\\end{align*}$$",
